<p>
    My friend Nicole Calzavara commissioned <a href="{{ client_link }}">a portfolio website</a> from me with a catch: it needed to have modular blocks for laying out pages, and be responsive and well-documented so she could easily add content and build layouts on the fly.
</p>

{{ await comp.ImageGrid({
    columns: 2,
    grid: [
        {
            image_url: "/uploads/DesignByNicole/DesignByNicole_darkmode.png",
            image_alt: "A page from Nicole Calzavara's website shown in dark mode"
