{{ await comp.Figure({
    image_url: "/uploads/DesignByNicole/DesignByNicole_ImageWithText.png",
    image_caption: "An Image-With-Text component showing a heading, blurb and an image",
})}}

<p>
    <a href="https://lume.land">Lume</a> was my choice of static site generator, and <a href="https://vento.js.org">Vento</a> was the templating language I used. For the modular "blocks" I used Lume components, which work similarly to JSX components.
</p>

<p>
    By referencing figma wireframes provided by Nicole, I developed each component along with thorough documentation, ensuring they would be flexible and responsive so she could use them for a variety of purposes.
</p>

{{ await comp.ImageGrid({
    columns: 2,
    grid: [
